# 4. Not implementable with the GeoPandas registry ###########################
#    Raster analysis (no raster layer exists in the catalog; adopt rasterio
#    when one does): abstr:Slope, abstr:Aspect, abstr:IDWInterval,
#    abstr:ClipFieldRaster2ObjectExtent, abstr:LocalMapAlgebra*, abstr:con1-3,
#    abstr:VelocityFieldDEM, abstr:RasterToIsoRaster, abstr:ZonalStatistics*,
#    abstr:RegionFromRasterExtent, abstr:ContourToFieldRaster,
#    abstr:CoverageToNominalFieldRaster, abstr:RasterToContourInterval,
#    abstr:ExtractByMask, abstr:ZonalStatisticsSize.
#    Network analysis (GeoPandas has no network solver; adopt networkx/osmnx
#    when needed): abstr:ClosestFacilityAnalysis, abstr:BuildNetwork.
#    Hydrology (out of scope; Amsterdam is flat): abstr:KrigingInterval,
#    abstr:FlowDirection, abstr:FlowAccumulation, abstr:FlowLength,
#    abstr:Watershed, abstr:SnapPourPoint, abstr:CreateUnitHydrograph.
